# Adult study gold bar (estudio 8)

Treat every adult estudio like finished **estudio 8** (`bible-studies/adult/8/` — *HACIENDO LO BUENO DE MANERA INCORRECTA*): precise structure, full verbatim Spanish, beautiful unique scenic images, Mount Zion logo on body slides, validate + PDF. Church teaching — care and professionalism, not stubs or “good enough.”

## Always

- Bound by **printed page numbers on the scan**. Title → `RESUMEN GENERAL`. Do not invent PDF-sheet stories as the source of truth.
- Working source: `studies/adult/{N}/` section folders. Verbatim print Spanish only.
- **Precise extract:** two-column wraps and page cuts must be joined (never drop the right-column leftover). Lectura/Texto: keep printed **`5:1` / `16:1`** at chapter jumps — do not strip to bare `1`.
- **Section vs TEMA verses (HARD):** TEMA image = tema `RANGO`. Each A/B image + Texto Bíblico = **that point’s verses only** (same cita). Never copy the full TEMA range onto every A/B Texto. Title chrome: `TEMA I - …` / `1.A - …` (spaces around the dash).
- **Scan coverage** must pass before calling a deck done. Spot-check last sentence of each A/B body + every chapter-change verse against the scan.
- Real scenic PNGs for `intro-header`, each `tema-N`, each `ab-N{Letter}` — unique scenes, left text-safe treatment. Never deliver placeholder cartoons.
- Images: Cursor (`cursor_api_key`) when OpenAI is unset; host OpenAI only when that key is set.
- Mount Zion logo (`Imagen 8`) on **intro body and every A/B body** slide; text above logo top.
- Definición = locked gold **layout** only; baked Spanish must be **this estudio’s** scan Definiciones (never reuse prior-study / gold-reference cards — build rejects those).
- Deliver: `bible-studies/adult/{N}/powerpoint/` + `pdf/` after `lamad validate` OK.

Full checklist: `AGENTS.md` → **Adult gold bar**. Layout: `lamad-cli/src/build/adult/LAYOUT_GUIDE.md`. External agents: `GENERATE_STUDY_AGENT.md`.
